<%
def url(page, params = nil)
  @base_url + "?page=" + page + (params ? "&#{params}" : "")
end

zone = @object
-%>
Hi <%= @user.login %>,

<% if @event.action_state['dns_primary_transfer_closure_reason'] == 'recovered' -%>
checks from every configured secondary to every configured primary for DNS
zone <%= zone.name %> have succeeded. These results confirm transfer readiness
at the time of each check. Each secondary's serving status and serial are
shown separately.
<% else -%>
the primary or secondary configuration for DNS zone <%= zone.name %> has
changed. The previous transfer-readiness alert has therefore been closed.
This does not confirm that removed primary servers recovered. Newly
configured paths remain pending until their checks complete.
<% end -%>

You can view the zone and its checks in vpsAdmin:

  <%= url('dns', "action=zone_show&id=#{zone.id}") %>

Best regards,

vpsFree.cz team

(This is an automated mail from vpsAdmin, your reply will be sent to our support)
